		</p>
		<div class="counter-badge" style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem; background: #e5e5e5; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block;">
			<strong>Profile Views:</strong> <span id="visitor-count">Loading...</span>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr />

	<!-- PROJECTS SECTION -->
	<section id="projects">
		<h1>Projects</h1>
		<p>
			Here are some of the projects I have worked on:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li><a href="/projects/project1">Project 1</a></li>
			<li><a href="/projects/project2">Project 2</a></li>
			<li><a href="/projects/project3">Project 3</a></li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<hr />

	<!-- EXPERIENCE SECTION -->
	<section id="experience">
		<h1>Experience</h1>
		<p>
			I have gained experience in various cloud platforms and technologies through internships and personal projects. Some of the key experiences include:
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Internship at XYZ Cloud Solutions</li>
			<li>Developed a serverless application using AWS Lambda</li>
